TFC Horizon — Horizon-native workshop mod (TerraFirmaCraft-inspired survival).

Inspired by TerraFirmaCraft (TFC) for Minecraft Java 1.20.1 as used in
TerraFirmaGreg-Modern packs. Not affiliated with TFC, Dries007,
AlcatrazEscapee, or the TFG authors. This is a clean reimplementation for
Horizon, not a jar port. Firmalife and other addons are out of scope.

Reference (read-only design): TerraFirmaCraft 1.20.1 mechanics.
Plan: docs/tfc-plan.md
Tracker: mods/tfc/tracker/catalog.json

Textures
--------
Selected block/item textures are taken from TerraFirmaCraft
(https://github.com/TerraFirmaCraft/TerraFirmaCraft, branch 1.20.x),
licensed under the European Union Public Licence v1.2 (EUPL-1.2).
See tools/fetch_tfc_textures.py. A copy of the EUPL text ships with
upstream TFC as LICENSE.txt; keep that notice when redistributing these
assets. Ore block faces are granite + TFC ore overlay composites.

Original Rust and JSON in this folder: MIT unless noted otherwise.
Minecraft / Mojang assets are not redistributed.
